  "title": "Granite Awarded $31 Million Early Works Package for Willow Rock Energy Storage Center in California",
  "summary": "WATSONVILLE, Calif.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--Granite (NYSE:GVA) announced today that it has been awarded an approximately $31 million Early Works Grading Package by Hydrostor for its Willow Rock Energy Storage Center (WRESC) Project, located north of Rosamond in Kern County, California. The award will be included in Granite’s third quarter 2026 CAP.",
